1. In your Nginx configuration, add a new location block that serves the `index.html` file with the modified JavaScript code:
```nginx
location / {
  root /usr/share/nginx/html;
  index index.html index.htm;
  try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;
  add_header Content-Type "text/html; charset=utf-8";
}
